    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Tonight's Pre-empt",
     "content": "Practice the night-before pre-emption ritual.\n\n1. Identify tomorrow's frog: the single task that, if completed, will create the most value or relief.\n2. Open the relevant file, folder, or document right now.\n3. Lay out any physical materials: textbook, notebook, charger, water.\n4. Write the first sentence of the task, even if rough. (If the task is non-writing, like a phone call, draft the first two lines you will say.)\n5. Close every unrelated tab. Set your phone to do-not-disturb for the first 60 minutes of tomorrow.\n\nTomorrow morning, do not check email, messages, or social media until the frog session is complete. Aim for 45-90 minutes of unbroken work. Note how the rest of your day feels.\n\nDeliverable: a one-page reflection comparing this morning to a typical morning, including time-to-first-meaningful-progress and overall day-end mood.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Practice: Tonight's Pre-empt</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Five-step night-before ritual</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 1: Identify Tomorrow's Frog</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Highest-value, most-likely-delayed task</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"310\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"365\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 2: Open the File</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Document, folder, or workspace ready to go</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"450\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"505\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 3: Stage the Materials</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"545\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Books, charger, water, notes laid out</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"590\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"645\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 4: Write the First Sentence</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Or draft first two lines of the call</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 5: Lock Down Distractions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Close tabs; do-not-disturb for first 60 min</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"870\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Deliverable</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"965\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">One-page next-day reflection</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Tonight's five steps determine tomorrow's first three hours."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Frog Inventory",
     "content": "Build a personal frog inventory across three time horizons. This is the foundation for every later lesson in this seminar.\n\n1. THIS WEEK: List your top three tasks. Circle the one that, if completed by Friday, would create the most relief, value, or future leverage. That is your weekly frog.\n2. THIS SEMESTER: List the three biggest goals or projects on your plate. Circle the one most likely to be derailed by procrastination. That is your semester frog.\n3. THIS YEAR / CAREER: Identify the one initiative — internship search, certification, portfolio, network — that would most reshape your trajectory if pursued seriously. That is your career frog.\n\nFor each of the three frogs, write a one-sentence answer to: 'What is the smallest first step I could take in the next 24 hours to move this forward?'\n\nDeliverable: a single page with your three frogs and three next steps. Bring it to lesson 2.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Practice: Frog Inventory</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Three frogs across three horizons</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"230\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Weekly Frog</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Top three tasks this week</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Circle the highest-relief task</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Define smallest next step in 24 hours</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"420\" width=\"940\" height=\"230\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Semester Frog</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Top three goals or projects this term</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Circle the one most at risk of being derailed</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Define smallest next step in 24 hours</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"670\" width=\"940\" height=\"230\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Career Frog</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Top initiative that reshapes your trajectory</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Internship, certification, portfolio, or network</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Define smallest next step in 24 hours</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"920\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"965\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bring your one-page inventory to lesson 2</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Three frogs, three first steps: the foundation for the seminar."
     }
    }
