     "title": "The Five-Minute Daily Diagnostic",
     "content": "Synthesize the 80/20 rule and three-question method into a five-minute daily ritual. Step one: list every task on your plate. Step two: circle the 20 percent most likely to produce 80 percent of your impact. Step three: among the circled, apply Question 1 (long-term), Question 2 (opportunity), Question 3 (only-you) and pick the highest scorer. Step four: stamp it A-1. Step five: pre-empt and begin. Five minutes; one frog identified with confidence.",
