     "title": "Practice: Find the Daily Frog",
     "content": "Test integrated application of the frog method.",
     "question": "It is Tuesday morning. Your weekly frog is finishing a 12-page case study due Friday. Your season frog is your senior thesis (Chapter 2 due in 3 weeks). Today's list also includes routine homework, a club meeting, and 30 emails. What is your daily A-1 frog?",
