      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Redesign Your Digital Environment</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Put technology back in its place</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"170\" width=\"860\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"245\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Measure your screen-time baseline</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Daily hours and total unlocks</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"315\" width=\"860\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"373\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Kill non-essential notifications</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Only real people needing real answers</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"460\" width=\"860\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"535\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"518\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Schedule two zones of silence</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"555\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Phone off, in another room</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"605\" width=\"860\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"680\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"663\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Batch your inputs into fixed windows</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"700\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Process email two or three times a day</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"750\" width=\"860\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"808\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Recruit one tool as a servant</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"845\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Configure it to protect your frogs</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"905\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"953\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Defending silence is a permanent practice</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Five moves that convert your devices from attention-thieves into frog-serving tools."
