     "type": "quiz",
     "title": "Practice: How the System Interlocks",
     "content": "Test your understanding of the integrated Eat That Frog system.",
     "question": "What does Tracy mean when he says the twenty-one rules form an integrated system rather than a menu of separate tips?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "You should pick only your two or three favorite rules and ignore the rest",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Each rule reinforces the others, so planning, prioritizing, focusing, and self-management run as one continuous loop",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "The rules must be performed in strict numerical order or they will not work at all",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "The rules are interchangeable, so it does not matter which ones you use or when",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Tracy's point is interlock: planning makes prioritizing possible, prioritizing makes focus meaningful, focus produces wins that fuel motivation, and motivation sends you back to plan again. The rules cluster into four phases that loop and strengthen each other. Cherry-picking a favorite two weakens the whole, and while the phases have a natural sequence, the rules are not a rigid numbered checklist nor a bag of interchangeable, order-free tricks. The power comes from running the connected loop.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">How the System Interlocks</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Integrated loop, not a menu of tips</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pick two favorites, ignore the rest</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wrong: cherry-picking weakens the whole</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"320\" width=\"940\" height=\"170\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"375\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Each rule reinforces the others</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Plan, prioritize, focus, self-manage as one loop</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"463\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Correct: the interlock is the power</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"510\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"565\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Must follow strict numerical order</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"608\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wrong: phases flow, not a rigid checklist</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"650\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Interchangeable, order does not matter</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"748\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wrong: the phases build on each other</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"800\" width=\"800\" height=\"165\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Run the connected loop every day</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"902\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wins fuel motivation, motivation fuels planning</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Eating the frog becomes the machine's output</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The system's power is the interlock: four phases reinforcing each other in a daily loop."
     }
